<%# locals: body -- code read-only in its frame (the Code field's look where it cannot be edited: the sunken
    ground, a line around it, the monospace face, its indentation kept). Shared by a translation tab's
    "Shared fields" (`Admin::EditorScreen::SharedFieldsComponent`) and a reference card's original
    (`Admin::Ui::ReferenceCardComponent`, `:code`). `body` is the text, or a word diff's markup.
    The line break after the opening tag is the one a browser drops, so a value that begins with
    one keeps it. %>
<pre tabindex="0" class="max-h-[12lh] overflow-auto rounded-cs border border-line bg-sunken p-2 font-cs-mono text-sm text-ink [tab-size:2]">
<%= body %></pre>
